(Sheldon:)What animal appears most often on flags?

3
00:00:05,694 --> 00:00:08,984
(Sheldon:)What animal appears second most often
on flags?

4
00:00:09,156 --> 00:00:10,986
(Sheldon:)And more.

5
00:00:11,992 --> 00:00:13,702
(Amy:)Sweet.

6
00:00:15,079 --> 00:00:16,869
(Sheldon:)Why are you waving a white flag?

7
00:00:17,039 --> 00:00:20,079
(Amy:)I'm surrendering to fun.

8
00:00:26,006 --> 00:00:30,756
Now, today's episode of Fun with Flags
is not fun...

9
00:00:30,928 --> 00:00:32,508
...but it is important.

10
00:00:32,679 --> 00:00:35,099
Flags, you gotta know how to hold them...

11
00:00:35,265 --> 00:00:37,605
...you gotta know how to fold them.

12
00:00:37,893 --> 00:00:41,063
Let's start by identifying
the parts of our flag.

13
00:00:41,230 --> 00:00:46,070
- This edge is the hoist and it's used to...
- Excuse me. Sorry, excuse me.

14
00:00:46,568 --> 00:00:48,318
(Sheldon:)Cut.

15
00:00:48,487 --> 00:00:50,197
(Sheldon:)Did you not see we are rolling?

16
00:00:50,364 --> 00:00:52,904
(Leonard:)I'm having dinner with Penny.
I have to get out of here.

17
00:00:53,075 --> 00:01:02,025
(Sheldon:)And I have flag knowledge
that I have to get out of here.

